WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.209 --> 00:00:04.004
♪♪

00:00:04.004 --> 00:00:07.132
Tyler:
Here. We. Go.

00:00:07.132 --> 00:00:08.508
♪♪

00:00:08.508 --> 00:00:12.304
Throughout Season 1, Shelia is
becoming this aerobics
personality.

00:00:12.304 --> 00:00:13.430
Are you ready to change?

00:00:13.430 --> 00:00:14.097
Women:
Yes!

00:00:14.723 --> 00:00:18.894
She gets approached by a
commercial agent who promises
her exciting things ahead.

00:00:19.478 --> 00:00:23.023
Rose Byrne:
Her husband, Danny loses the
local election that he’s running for.

00:00:23.023 --> 00:00:26.818
You see these two broken people
and you wonder, well, how are
they in a relationship together? 

00:00:26.818 --> 00:00:28.987
I don’t remember asking you for
your input.

00:00:29.529 --> 00:00:32.157
Rose Byrne:
She struggled with all
relationships, but particularly with women.

00:00:32.157 --> 00:00:34.618
I have a really hard time
opening up to other women.

00:00:34.618 --> 00:00:38.038
The dynamics between women can
sometimes be complex

00:00:38.038 --> 00:00:40.499
and Greta really values her
relationship with Sheila.

00:00:41.208 --> 00:00:43.085
Bunny is very suspicious to
Sheila.

00:00:43.085 --> 00:00:45.087
Della Saba:
Bunny envies Sheila.

00:00:45.087 --> 00:00:49.716
Her business did not take off
and now she and Tyler are paying
the consequences.

00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:50.884
I get a bad feeling.

00:00:50.884 --> 00:00:52.427
I get a rad feeling too.

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:55.013
Sheila’s in the midst of her
addiction.

00:00:55.013 --> 00:00:56.974
Rose Byrne:
She's found strength through the
aerobics

00:00:56.974 --> 00:01:00.394
Rose Byrne:
and then she starts this very
strange thing with John Breem.

00:01:01.019 --> 00:01:02.396
What’s next, Sheila?

00:01:03.438 --> 00:01:07.776
Rose Byrne:
Season 2 is the beginning of
Sheila breaking free and doing it her own way.

00:01:08.443 --> 00:01:10.487
She's desperately trying to get
her business started.

00:01:11.905 --> 00:01:14.825
Bunny and Tyler finally have the
dirt on Sheila.

00:01:15.701 --> 00:01:18.537
Della Saba:
We've been leading up to getting
our revenge.

00:01:18.537 --> 00:01:19.871
She took everything.

00:01:19.871 --> 00:01:21.623
Then let’s take it back.

00:01:22.124 --> 00:01:26.086
Greta and Sheila's relationship
has grown a lot in between the
seasons.

00:01:26.086 --> 00:01:27.879
Hello Gorgeous.

00:01:28.046 --> 00:01:30.090
The Rubin’s are definitely in a
different place now.

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:31.216
 I hate you!

00:01:32.134 --> 00:01:32.718
(Scoff)

00:01:32.718 --> 00:01:35.429
Rose Byrne:
There’s a brand new character
this season, Vinnie Green

00:01:35.429 --> 00:01:38.056
Rose Byrne:
who's this strange competitor
slash mentor.

00:01:38.056 --> 00:01:41.685
We could get you on a road to a
healthy, happy new you.

00:01:41.685 --> 00:01:45.397
She figures out a way to win,
which doesn't always mean it's
the right way to do it.

00:01:45.397 --> 00:01:46.356
(Laughs)

00:01:46.356 --> 00:01:50.527
Sheila:
5... 4... 3... 2... 1...

00:01:51.111 --> 00:01:52.237
Sheila:
Here we go!

